WEBVTT

00:04:57.645 --> 00:05:00.899
The second reason is that these governments,

00:05:00.899 --> 00:05:02.725
just like all the rest of us,

00:05:02.725 --> 00:05:05.350
are cultural psychopaths.

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:06.657
I don't mean to be rude,

00:05:06.657 --> 00:05:08.064
but you know what a psychopath is.

00:05:08.064 --> 00:05:09.792
A psychopath is a person who,

00:05:09.792 --> 00:05:11.329
unfortunately for him or her,

00:05:11.329 --> 00:05:13.368
lacks the ability to really empathize

00:05:13.368 --> 00:05:15.181
with other human beings.

00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:16.320
When they look around,

00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:17.982
they don't see other human beings

00:05:17.982 --> 00:05:21.096
with deep, rich, three-dimensional personal lives

00:05:21.096 --> 00:05:22.224
and aims and ambitions.

00:05:22.224 --> 00:05:25.221
What they see is cardboard cutouts,

00:05:25.221 --> 00:05:27.794
and it's very sad and it's very lonely,

00:05:27.794 --> 00:05:30.532
and it's very rare, fortunately.